/Title (The Alarm Clock project is a Linux-based system designed to provide a simple and reliable way to schedule and trigger alarms at a specified time. The application monitors the system clock and notifies the user when the scheduled alarm time is reached. The project mainly focuses on demonstrating Operating Systems and system programming concepts through Linux/POSIX mechanisms.)
