<<
/Title (An Alarm Clock is a time-based system that allows users to schedule an alarm for a specific time and receive a notification when the set time is reached. In this project, a Linux-based Alarm Clock is developed to demonstrate how Operating Systems and system programming concepts can be used to implement time-dependent tasks.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 524 0 R
/Next 555 0 R
>>
